The legal text is the Constitution of the Republic of the Union of Myanmar (2008), English version, printed by
the Printing and Publishing Enterprise, Ministry of Information, Myanmar, in September 2008. It is a state legal
text and no licence is stated for it. It was read from the copy held by the Online Burma/Myanmar Library
(https://www.burmalibrary.org).

The Penal Code (India Act XLV, 1860), text incorporating amendments to 25 March 2019, is the Myanmar Law Information System
text, a state legal text with no stated licence, read from the copy held by UNODC SHERLOC (https://sherloc.unodc.org).

The Contract Act (India Act IX, 1872) is a state legal text with no stated licence, read from the copy held by the
Myanmar Law Library (https://www.myanmar-law-library.org).

The Myanmar Companies Law (Pyidaungsu Hluttaw Law No. 29, 2017), English text, is a state legal text with no stated licence,
read from the Directorate of Investment and Company Administration (https://www.myco.dica.gov.mm).

